    <section class="local-content">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Installations and repairs in Chelsea</h2>
            <p>Bremray is a licensed and insured electrical contractor based in Ann Arbor. We serve Chelsea homeowners and occasionally work in small stores and schools.</p>
            <div class="services-grid">
                <article class="service-card">
                    <h3><a href="/ev-charger-installation.html">EV charger installation</a></h3>
                    <p>Tell us what you drive and where you park. We can plan the wiring and check the power available, whether you've picked a charger or still need help choosing one.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="service-card">
                    <h3><a href="/electrical-panel-upgrade.html">Panel upgrades</a></h3>
                    <p>We replace panels and check whether your electrical service can support new equipment. We'll explain what needs attention before recommending the work.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="service-card">
                    <h3><a href="/generators.html">Backup generators</a></h3>
                    <p>Keep the equipment you need running during an outage. We install automatic standby generators and connections for portable generators.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="service-card">
                    <h3><a href="/residential-electrical.html">Electrical work around the house</a></h3>
                    <p>We install lights, ceiling fans, outlets, and new circuits. We also troubleshoot problems and repair wiring.</p>
                </article>
