            <h3>Start with what you know</h3>
            <p>You don't need to choose equipment before contacting us. Tell us what you want to do, where the work is, and how to reach you. If you already have a charger, fan, or other equipment, include the model.</p>
            <p>We'll review your request and follow up about the work. We may need to visit before we can give you a price.</p>
